Yucky-poo!  I thought we agreed at some point never to use "mass" again; it=
 has=20
been used over the years for at least four clearly different things and at =
least=20
as many that were not clear at all.  All of the useful notions have been sp=
un=20
off in different ways now, so there is no need for this term.  The role of =
'lo'=20
is one of the old senses of "mass", now clearly explicated: this"mass" does=
=20
something if all the members participate in doing it (what counts as=20
participation varies with specific activities and is open to some fights). =
=20




